  "title": "Runtime driver attestation",
  "summary": "Windows can produce a signed runtime attestation report listing loaded drivers together with code-integrity information, which a service validates on its backend. It gives an anti-cheat or security product visibility into driver loads that happened before it started, without polling the system itself.",
